  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals, for detection of rifampicin resistance by LC-aNAATs, in two panels: smear positive and smear negative, each with 6 studies (1 Truenat MTB-RIF Dx, 5 Xpert Ultra). Truenat MTB-RIF Dx (Gomathi 2020) has the lowest sensitivity in both panels (0.57 and 0.17).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط غابي للحساسية والنوعية مع فترات ثقة 95%، للكشف عن مقاومة الريفامبيسين باختبارات LC-aNAAT، في لوحتين: إيجابي اللطاخة وسلبي اللطاخة، تضم كل منهما 6 دراسات (دراسة واحدة لاختبار Truenat MTB-RIF Dx و5 لاختبار Xpert Ultra). ولاختبار Truenat MTB-RIF Dx (Gomathi 2020) أدنى حساسية في اللوحتين (0.57 و0.17).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "灵敏度和特异度森林图（含95%置信区间），LC-aNAATs检测利福平耐药，分为两个图组：涂片阳性和涂片阴性，各含6项研究（1项Truenat MTB-RIF Dx，5项Xpert Ultra）。Truenat MTB-RIF Dx（Gomathi 2020）在两个图组中灵敏度均最低（0.57和0.17）。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
